      "review_description": "At the time of signing the contract, 18 months ago,we advised that we wanted to cover our power bills for Electric floor heating a well as general electricity and we had both 1phase & 3phase power. We were advised we were able to have all that done for us.We paid $16,000 up front and to their word the installation was done on time as promised.  We waited until Jan 2012 for Powercore to finish connectionsalong with Sunbursts Electricians. however 10 months later we find we are still not connected to the  Solar power and have paid one power bill of $1,700 and have another one due for $1.880. The after sales service is non existent.The electrical work is woeful and they cannot connect floor heating, or get the wiring correct.BE VERY CAREFUL AND CHECK THOROUGHLY BEFORE COMMITTING.",
